  guideTitle: "Curtain Fabric Guide: Linen, Velvet, Polyester and Cotton Compared",
  metaTitle: "Curtain Fabric Guide: Linen to Velvet",
  metaDescription: "Compare linen, velvet, polyester and cotton curtains for drape, light control, sun damage, fullness and washing, and learn what lining does for each.",
  heroImage: "/images/articles/curtainfabric-hotel-floor-length-pair.webp",
